Package: catchmentACS
Title: Isochrone-Based Area-Weighted ACS Aggregation
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("JoonHo", "Lee", , "jlee296@ua.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
Description: Generates drive-time isochrones from arbitrary lat/lng points
    and aggregates American Community Survey (ACS) tract-level estimates to
    those isochrones via area-weighted intersection. The current beta supports
    OSRM and OpenRouteService routing providers; Mapbox, r5r, and population
    weighting are reserved fail-loud surfaces for future releases. Includes
    demo-safe OSRM defaults, condition capture with return values,
    drive-time-aware per-site rate summaries, fingerprint-protected persistent
    cache entries, corrected ACS rate derivation including
    ssi_rate = B19056_002 / B19056_001, validation, cache, provenance
    description, and leaflet visual walkthrough helpers for auditable Pre-K
    catchment analysis.
